 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.32,
   "text": "In the previous What If, we opened a portal at the bottom of the Mariana Trench, and we",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 3.32,
   "end": 4.32,
   "text": "let the oceans drain out.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 4.58,
   "end": 5.82,
   "text": "For fun, we drained them to Mars.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 6.02,
   "end": 9.48,
   "text": "The Curiosity rover is working so hard to find evidence of liquid water, so I figured",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 9.48,
   "end": 10.78,
   "text": "we could make things easier for it.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 11.08,
   "end": 12.76,
   "text": "How would Mars change as the water accumulated?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 13.24,
   "end": 15.24,
   "text": "There is a lot of water currently on Mars.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 15.44,
   "end": 16.86,
   "text": "The problem is, it's mostly frozen.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 17.4,
   "end": 20.34,
   "text": "Liquid water doesn't last long there, because Mars is too cold and there's too little air.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 20.64,
   "end": 23.42,
   "text": "But the oceans we're dumping onto Mars wouldn't freeze solid any time soon.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 23.72,
   "end": 26.98,
   "text": "We're dumping a lot of water very fast, and Mars isn't that cold.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 26.98,
   "end": 30.7,
   "text": "Plus, the oceans are saltwater, and salt makes it slightly harder for water to freeze.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 31.34,
   "end": 32.52,
   "text": "Here's an elevation map of Mars.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 32.92,
   "end": 36.66,
   "text": "Currently Curiosity is sitting in Gale Crater, a round depression in the Martian surface with",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 36.66,
   "end": 38.46,
   "text": "a peak, nicknamed Mount Sharp, in the center.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 38.78,
   "end": 41.9,
   "text": "We're dumping a lot of water very fast, which will start to turn Gale Crater into",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 41.9,
   "end": 43.22,
   "text": "a lake, just like it would on Earth.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 43.62,
   "end": 46.76,
   "text": "As the flow continues, the lake fills in, burying Curiosity under hundreds of meters",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 46.76,
   "end": 47.24,
   "text": "of water.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 47.7,
   "end": 50.98,
   "text": "Oddly, the water would freeze from above and below at the same time, because the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 50.98,
   "end": 52.6,
   "text": "Martian surface is also below freezing.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 53.12,
   "end": 56.48,
   "text": "Rocks and soil would almost certainly become frozen together into ice-dirt chunks that",
   "avg_logprob": -0.126,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 56.48,
   "end": 58.96,
   "text": "break free and float up to the surface like icebergs.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 59.08,
   "end": 62.04,
   "text": "The water spills over the north rim of the crater and starts flowing out across the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 62.04,
   "end": 62.32,
   "text": "sand.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 62.74,
   "end": 66.34,
   "text": "The water flows downhill to the north, and pools in the North Polar Basin, while a layer",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 66.34,
   "end": 68.38,
   "text": "of sea ice and rockbergs forms on top.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 68.96,
   "end": 72.14,
   "text": "Eventually, the flow breaks through into the Hellas Impact Crater, the basin covering",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 72.14,
   "end": 76.32,
   "text": "the lowest point on Mars, and perseverance is likely destroyed in the ensuing ice-rock",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 76.32,
   "end": 76.8,
   "text": "waterfall.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 77.26,
   "end": 78.82,
   "text": "And then, at last, the flow stops.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 79.22,
   "end": 83.58,
   "text": "The oceans back on Earth are drained, and the rovers all have water damage and are",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 83.58,
   "end": 84.62,
   "text": "now probably out of warranty.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.143
  },
  {
   "start": 85.12,
   "end": 87.74,
   "text": "We're covering the planet with an enormous amount of ice-topped water.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.147,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.044
  },
  {
   "start": 88.06,
   "end": 90.84,
   "text": "The ice would get thicker and thicker as the water below it cooled, and eventually the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.147,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.044
  },
  {
   "start": 90.84,
   "end": 91.92,
   "text": "oceans would freeze solid.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.147,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.044
  },
  {
   "start": 92.52,
   "end": 93.98,
   "text": "Except maybe none of this would happen.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.147,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.044
  },
  {
   "start": 94.36,
   "end": 97.9,
   "text": "Water is a potent greenhouse gas, and with so much new water available to evaporate into",
   "avg_logprob": -0.147,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.044
  },
  {
   "start": 97.9,
   "end": 101.38,
   "text": "the atmosphere, maybe Mars would warm up and the oceans would remain liquid as they",
   "avg_logprob": -0.147,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.044
  },
  {
   "start": 101.38,
   "end": 102.06,
   "text": "are here on Earth.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.147,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.044
  },
  {
   "start": 102.62,
   "end": 103.72,
   "text": "There's only one way to find out.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.147,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.044
  }
 ],
